<title>RUSSIA: Russia's securities watchdog extends RTS licence.</title>
<headline>Russia's securities watchdog extends RTS licence.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's securities watchdog, the Federal Commission for the Securities Market, extended a trading licence to the Russian Trading System (RTS) non-commercial partnership until July 1, 1998, the commission said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The RTS over-the-counter type system has many similarities to the U.S.'s NASDAQ market.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
